    "Plan {days} days at {where} with these wishes: {wishes}. Table (Day | Morning | Afternoon | Evening | Alone time?), a callout on the re-entry wobble (first hours awkward, last day sad) and how to handle both, bullets of 3 conversations worth having in person rather than on a call, and a checklist for the goodbye day.",
