    "Occasions: {occasions}; distances: {distance}; kids: {kids}. Propose 3 rotation systems as cards (meta = fairness · travel load), a table for the next 2 years (Occasion | Year 1 | Year 2 | Notes), a quote announcing the plan to both families warmly, and bullets on handling the family that feels short-changed.",
